  "data": {
    "summary": "[SUSTAINED HITS 2] counts only when this attack targets a unit with neither MONSTER nor VEHICLE. If even one model in the target unit has either keyword, the whole unit counts as having it, so the ability does nothing. Otherwise each critical hit scores 2 extra hits on the target, so that attack hits it three times in total.",
